-12 (reboxetine), a highly selective and potent norepinephrine reuptake inhibitor and cortical dopamine modulator, which has completed Phase II trial to treat narcolepsy; AXS-14 (esreboxetine), a selective and potent norepinephrine reuptake inhibitor that has completed Phase III trial for the treatment of fibromyalgia and other conditions; and Solriamfetol, a dopamine and norepinephrine reuptake inhibitor, which is in Phase III trial for treating attention deficit hyperactivity, major depressive, binge eating, and excessive sleepiness associated with shift work disorder. It has a research collaboration agreement with Duke University for evaluating AXS-05 in a Phase 2 clinical trial in smoking cessation treatment. The company was incorporated in 2012 and is based in New York, New York.","employees":1346,"website":"https://www.axsome.com","country":"United States","city":"New York","officers":[{"name":"Dr. Herriot  Tabuteau M.D.","title":"Founder, Chairman, CEO & President"},{"name":"Mr. Nick  Pizzie CPA, M.B.A.","title":"Chief Financial Officer"},{"name":"Mr. Mark L. Jacobson M.A.","title":"Chief Operating Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":18.89,"tpe":30.04,"ps":4.318,"pfcf":28.14,"peg":1.36,"pb":4.619,"ev_ebitda":16.75,"rev_growth":0.1,"eps_growth":0.167,"eps_growth_fwd":0.0928,"eps_growth_next":0.1205,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.01454,"roa":0.02187,"de":41.94,"gross_margin":0.4983,"op_margin":0.04015,"profit_margin":0,"current_ratio":3.084},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":38.84,"sector":18.89,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":-1,"sector":30.04,"verdict":"Loss-making"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":9.667,"sector":4.318,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":-1,"sector":28.14,"verdict":"Negative FCF"},{"k":"peg","label":"PEG","v":null,"sector":1.36,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"pb","label":"Price / Book","v":89.97,"sector":4.619,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"de","label":"Debt / Equity (%)","v":269.7,"sector":